New: MatrixFreeTools::compute_matrix() now has an overload for
Portable::MatrixFree that assembles a Tpetra sparse matrix on the device
from a quadrature-point operation. It handles hanging-node constraints and
sets constrained diagonal entries to one. Currently, this overload supports
only a single MPI process.
<br>
(Timo Heister, 2026/11/27)
